BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Devilsfootbrew": "https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/s-i-m-market/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:devilsfootbrew
X-SOURCE:The Mule at Devils Foot
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260716T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260716T210000
DTSTAMP:20260716T231337
CREATED:20260709T181740Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260709T181740Z
UID:10001677-1784221200-1784235600@devilsfootbrew.com
SUMMARY:S.I.M Market
DESCRIPTION:Service Industry Market\nRemember spending hours building the perfect Sim\, decorating their dream home\, and giving them the coolest creative life? The Service Industry Market is where that imagination meets real life. \nThis market celebrates the makers\, shakers\, bakers\, and creators behind the Asheville service industry. The bartenders\, servers\, baristas and other industry folks who clock out and pour their creativity into art\, handmade goods\, vintage finds\, jewelry\, and more! \nCome browse unique creations\, support local makers\, and discover the incredible talent hiding behind the apron\, behind the bar\, and behind the scenes. Every purchase supports someone who spends their days taking care of everyone else. \nCalling All Service Industry Creators! \nGot a side hustle? We’d love to have you at the SIM Market. \nIf you work in Asheville’s service industry and create anything—art\, ceramics\, jewelry\, clothing\, baked goods\, home décor\, prints\, vintage collections\, or anything uniquely yours—we want you to be part of this event! \nPlease email Hannah at hannah@devilsfootbrew.com to secure your spot. \nNo vendor fees or cheat codes required. Just creativity\, community\, and a love for supporting local!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/s-i-m-market/
CATEGORIES:Market
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/SIM-Market-Instagram-Post-45.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=27c8ebf28d4c6dd7019a941b5d4bd42f
END:VEVENT
