DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T230000
DTSTAMP:20260716T231337
CREATED:20260522T173956Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260618T184350Z
UID:10001232-1784314800-1784329200@devilsfootbrew.com
SUMMARY:Fire Friday w/Miss Vee & Liba Ariel
DESCRIPTION:Turn Up The Heat on Fridays!\nJoin us for Fire Friday\, a monthly outdoor gathering celebrating fire arts\, flow movement\, and immersive performance culture at The Mule. This event creates a safe\, structured\, and welcoming space for experienced fire performers\, beginners interested in learning\, and community members who simply want to watch\, dance\, and enjoy the atmosphere. \nHosted and managed by Liba Ariel and Miss Vee\, the burn circle will include clear safety protocols\, organized participant flow\, and guidance for anyone wanting to enter the world of fire performance. \nWhether you’re spinning flames or just soaking in the glow\, Fire Friday is about connection\, creativity\, and community. \n\n Learn More & Get Tickets!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/fire-friday-w-miss-vee-liba-ariel-3/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/1-4.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=bc027acc2853de11687e846eabd4d62d
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315188281/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_315188281@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260717T031304Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T210000
SUMMARY:This Version of You - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Guest DJ Bobcat
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 17th\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGues
 t DJ Bobcat \\| Facilitator Kris Hostikka\n\nIntention: This Version of Yo
 u\n\nWhat if nothing needed fixing tonight?\nWhat if this version of you w
 as enough to dance from?\nCan you welcome the person who arrived tonight?\
 nNot the person you hope to become.\nNot the person you used to be.\nNot t
 he healed version.\nNot the optimized version.\nJust this version.\nThe on
 e carrying whatever they are carrying.\nThe one who made it here.\nThe one
  breathing\, moving\, listening.\nCan this version of you say yes to this 
 moment?\n\n## About Guest DJ Bobcat\n\nBob Swoap crafts journeys that invi
 te dancers to deeply connect: with themselves\, others\, nature\, and the 
 music. He layers genres and world rhythms into an emotionally engaging set
 . At Warren Wilson College -- where he is professor of psychology and expr
 essive arts therapy -- Bob facilitates ecstatic dance as a part of the com
 munity wellness program\, bringing a grounded\, experienced presence to th
 e floor. Favorite place to dance: outside at the WWC Pavilion.\n\n\\~\\~\\
 ~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close 
 promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Ple
 ase be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Price
 s: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\
 nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunt
 eer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovem
 entcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volu
 nteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2
 lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_
 3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\n
 Door will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO EN
 TRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://a
 shevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0R
 XNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_L
 MLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsh
 eville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where a
 ll are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mi
 ssion and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through fr
 ee-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transforma
 tion. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\,
  Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315188281/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260609T204102Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T204102Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
