SUMMARY:CAST IRON
DESCRIPTION:\nAsheville's Cast Iron returns to the Jack of the Wood stage w
 ith their "original traditional bluegrass"! Coupling infectious energy wit
 h authentic Appalachian charm\, Cast Iron delivers foot-stomping rhythms a
 nd heartwarming melodies that will have you tapping your toes all night lo
 ng.\n\n\n\nWith their vocals\, instrumentals\, and genuine passion for the
  genre\, the band invites you to experience the soulful essence of Appalac
 hia. Grab your friends\, grab a pint\, and get ready for an evening of blu
 egrass that you won't soon forget!\n\n\n\nMusic 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at 
 the door.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HRPSQpvAzc8\n\n
 \n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0G79Td5O66w\n\n
