SUMMARY:Lion Life
DESCRIPTION:New students enrolling in August are strongly encouraged to attend a Lion Life Orientation session. \nLion Life is designed to provide new students with an introduction to life at Mars Hill University. Enrolling students are strongly encouraged to attend a Lion Life Orientation session. Students only need to attend one session and can choose the session that best fits within their schedule from several different options for the date of their Lion Life. \nAt Lion Life\, you will receive important information to prepare you for the fall semester\, connect with faculty and staff\, receive your fall class schedule (after completing the class schedule questionnaire)\, and meet some of your new classmates! While Lion Life takes place throughout the summer\, we do hope you will gain a sense of family at MHU. \nMore information about Lion Life \nDowload the Lion Life schedule for STUDENTS \nDownload the Lion Life schedule for FAMILIES \n 
