SUMMARY:WNC Sierra Club: Annual Summer Picnic
DESCRIPTION:WNC Sierra Club\nJoin us for our annual summer picnic on July 
 18 at West Asheville Park! This is a great opportunity to meet like-minded
  folks and enjoy some good food\, games and music.\nWe are excited to anno
 unce that a special guest will join us at 3 p.m. Don't miss the opportunit
 y to hear **NC Supreme Court Justice Anita Earls**. She will talk about wh
 y her race is so important for the future of our democracy in North Caroli
 na.\nPlease bring a potluck dish to share\, along with labels showing ingr
 edients\, which are helpful for those with dietary needs.
