X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315188307/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_315188307@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260717T031304Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260719T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260719T123000
SUMMARY:Shifting - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, July 19th\n1st Dance W
 ave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wav
 e 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitator 
 Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: Shifting\n\nLet's dance the internal shifts wit
 hin ourselves. Let's dance the shifts in consciousness that speak to the w
 ild possibilities of our imagination. Let's dance the collective changes w
 e are experiencing now\, in this moment in time\, and those we dream for O
 ur Future.\n“You are not a drop in the ocean. You are the entire ocean i
 n a drop.” *― Rumi*\n\n“Cultural shifts happen on a different level\
 ; they come into view only when we step back enough to see a bigger pictur
 e changing over time. A newspaper photograph viewed through a magnifying g
 lass may appear only as tiny dots. When it seems as if our lives and choic
 es are like those dots\, it can be difficult to recognize their contributi
 on to a bigger picture of change.” *― Joanna Macy*\n\n“A dream is no
 t reality\, but who's to say which is which?” *― Alice Through the Loo
 king Glass\, Lewis Carroll*\n\n## About Sara Bensman\n\nSara’s mix-makin
 g arises from musical exploration. She seeks to understand energy through 
 somatic responses to sonic vibrations. Her facilitation is propelled by a 
 desire to help build and sustain community by creating a safe\, loving con
 tainer for self-expression\, connection and release. If you’d like to li
 sten to her sets visit [https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman](https://sound
 cloud.com/sara-bensman)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance st
 arts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that c
 ome late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secur
 e container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo on
 e turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTE
 ER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volun
 teer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExM
 FZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1
 XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA
 )\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the o
 pening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nC
 ollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/
 ](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0C
 MTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR
 4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB
 1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a wo
 rld that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves 
 within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity
  and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for 
 personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organi
 zation.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the d
 ance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315188307/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260609T204300Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T204300Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
