SUMMARY:Summer Camp Tournament of Games & More!
DESCRIPTION:Take Me Back To Summer Camp!\nAll grown up and no camp days scheduled? We’ve got you covered! We’re throwing together a whole day of fun sure to bring back those sweet Summer memories from when we were kids. In addition to our team tournament of games\, we’ll have all sorts of activities like a tie-dye station\, chalk art\, yard games\, water guns\, a giant parachute and more\, with a live band to follow the tourney. \nAll are welcome to participate in the festivities and the event is free to attend. The Tournament itself will be pre-registration only and is 21+. \nThe Tournament: 12-3pm\nThe tournament is 21 + and free to register. Teams will consist of 4-6 players\, maxed at 12 teams\, so don’t delay! Tournament games include tug-o-war\, target shoot (with water guns)\, wheel barrow relay races and more. It’s meant to be goofy and ridiculous\, so call on your childlike wonder and playfulness and come join us. \nPrizes will be awarded to the tournament winner\, best team name and best team costume. \n REGISTER HERE!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/summer-camp-tournament-of-games-more/
CATEGORIES:Fun & Games
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/IG-Tournament-of-Games.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=130f413a06b89a0ccec3dda80252b38d
END:VEVENT
