X-SOURCE-ID:buncombe_dems
SUMMARY:How to Engage Un-engaged Voters
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T170000
UID:d54dc9aefbedc890f056a6b9842a8ed8@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/How%20to%20Engage%20Voters%20-%20Mobilize_2026052719134820192
 0.png
DESCRIPTION:Please join Precinct 44.1 and welcome Heather Heckel\, PhD\, a
  long-time teacher and practitioner of advocacy and community engagement t
 o discuss: * How we can effectively connect with people with whom we somet
 imes disagree. * How we can engage those who are not yet motivated to vote
 . * What well-meaning strategies might "backfire." * How we can reduce pol
 arization. * How we can use our time most effectively to amplify our voice
 s\, magnify our impact and strengthen our community. Light refreshments
LOCATION:Enka-Candler Library\, 1404 Sand Hill Rd\, Candler\, NC\, 28715
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/961472/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Buncombe County Democratic Party": "https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/969777/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:buncombe_dems
SUMMARY:Join Democrats in learning how to fight against the degradation of
  our public lands!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T173000
UID:33ff03b0408c4427a2f82bc7de44c998@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Join%20Democrats_20260609002744435908.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us to hear Josh Kelly from MountainTrue speak about the T
 rump administration's plan to repeal the "roadless rule" which will open u
 p thousands of acres of national forests to logging in Western North Carol
 ina. He will discuss how this will dramatically impact our public lands an
 d how to fight back against the Republican plan. Who should attend: All in
 terested Democrats and left leaning Unaffiliateds
LOCATION:East Asheville Library - Community Room\, 3 Avon Rd\, Asheville\,
  NC\, 28805
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/969777/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
