DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nJoin us for an intentional ritual for Leo season\n
 When the sun moves into a new sign an energetic shift occurs. Learning to 
 connect\, listen\, and set intentions with the sun is a beautiful way to a
 dd ritual into your life.\nCancer season is from 7/22 - 8/22 and for this 
 gathering we'll discuss the Astrological happenings of the zodiac season a
 nd where it will impact you personally (birth chart recommended).\nAs with
  all energetic shifts\, getting into your body is important. Together we'l
 l ground into the energy through meditation and movement themed around the
  season. Accommodations/Modification can be made for ALL bodies\, come as 
 you are.\nWe'll close out with time for journaling and optional sharing.\n
 Donation Recommend: $15-20
