SUMMARY:Jason Whitaker at the Hilton Garden Inn South!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n# Start your weekend with melodic tunes
  at the Garden Inn South\, featuring Jason Whitaker\n\nATTENDEE LIMIT HAS 
 BEEN INCREASED TO ACCOMODATE MORE.\n\nEnjoy your friends and the food and 
 drinks from the Garden Grille & Bar while listening to Jason Whitaker (He 
 plays from 6pm - 9pm).\n\nJason is an expressive multi decade Light Rock g
 uitarist and balladeer (think: Eagles\, Clapton\, Seger\, James Taylor\, J
 im Croce\, Mellencamp\, Fleetwood Mac\, Bon Jovi\, even a little Elvis). C
 ome unwind with us at the relaxing and comfortable garden setting for a mu
 sical evening at the Hilton by the Asheville Outlets.\n\nThere is free par
 king in both the front of the hotel and behind it as well.\nCarpooling is 
 encouraged.\n\nThe Hilton is right near the Asheville Tanger Outlet Mall. 
 Take Exit 33 (Brevard Road) off Highway 26. Parking is free!\n\nThe music 
 is free! Please show your appreciation by tipping.\n\n**Hilton Garden Inn 
 Asheville South**\n9 Rocky Ridge Rd\nAsheville\, NC 28806\nPhone: (828) 63
 3-6024
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillesocial/events/315193295/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260610T034809Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T034809Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Devilsfootbrew": "https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/feelin-good-foolin-around-a-spotlight-film-night/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:devilsfootbrew
X-SOURCE:The Mule at Devils Foot
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T220000
DTSTAMP:20260716T231337
CREATED:20260701T213434Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260701T213434Z
UID:10001669-1784916000-1784930400@devilsfootbrew.com
SUMMARY:Feelin' Good & Foolin' Around: A Spotlight Film Night
DESCRIPTION: Lights\, laughter\, action!\nJoin AVL Film for Feelin’ Good & Foolin’ Around\, a one-of-a-kind night of comedy\, cinema\, and community at The Mule on Friday\, July 24. In partnership with Carrboro Film Fest\, this spirited evening features six standout short films from talented regional filmmakers\, plus live music\, improv by Dad Bod\, and an engaging Q&A with several of the filmmakers. Expect quirky comedies\, unexpected romances\, and stories that will have you laughing out loud\, feeling all the feels\, and celebrating the incredible creative talent of the Southeast. It’s the perfect summer night out for film lovers and anyone looking for a memorable Asheville experience. \n Grab Your Tickets Now!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/feelin-good-foolin-around-a-spotlight-film-night/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/July24_Cinema_IG.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=69a4abfc96317a641471852872bf26d0
END:VEVENT
