X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Jackofthewood Events Ics": "https://jackofthewood.com/events/greenwood-rye/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:jackofthewood_events_ics
X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:3729@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T233000
DTSTAMP:20260627T173915Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/greenwood-rye/
SUMMARY:Greenwood Rye
DESCRIPTION:\nGreenwood Rye is a modern jam-grass band\, formed in Nashvill
 e as the house band for the award-winning bluegrass supper club\, Jane's H
 ideaway. Led by Shawn Spencer (Seven Handle Circus) on Guitar and Vocals\,
  the band 's main cast features Cat McDonald (Fiddle\, Vox)\, David Freema
 n (Mandolin\, Vox)\, Taylor Shuck (Banjo) &amp\; Andy Brown (Upright Bass)
 .\n\n\n\nThe group writes fun\, modern songs that are rooted in bluegrass\
 , throwing in some jam-band tendencies\, and an occasional kick-drum or de
 lay pedal.&nbsp\; And they love performing fresh renditions of eclectic co
 vers of all genres done with the beautiful sounds of acoustic bluegrass in
 struments.\n\n\n\nTheir latest album\, "Hideaway" had a single\, "Down to 
 the River" debuted by Bluegrass Situation and two singles placed on Spotif
 y's Official Editorial "New Grass" Playlist.&nbsp\; The album that was rel
 eased just last August already has over 370k Spotify streams.\n\n\n\nRecen
 tly they have been venturing further and further from Nashville\, playing 
 on festivals such as ROMP\, Americanafest\, Official IBMA Showcase\, Albin
 o Skunk and a slew of other small festivals\, clubs\, events and house con
 certs.&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nCurrently they are in residence at The Countrypolitan
  in Nashville\, where they play every week for locals and tourists from ac
 ross the country who come to Nashville looking for a great\, authentic mus
 ic experience.&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nThe residency also features regular guest app
 earances by some of Nashville’s greatest young bluegrass players includi
 ng Frank Evans (Bronwyn Keith-Hines\, Slocan Ramblers)\, Sasha Ostrovsky (
 Darius Rucker)\, Josey Toney(Haily Whitters)\, Josh Rilko (Sierra Ferrell\
 , Lindsey Lou)\, Oliver Craven (Stray Birds\, Sierra Ferrell)\, Alex Genov
 a (Fireside Collective\, Jason Carter) Tony Aichelle (Travis Tritt\, Morga
 n Wallen)\, Larry Cook (Tony Trishka)\, Brenna MacMillan Ben Plotnick on F
 iddle\, Mandolin\, Bass\, Dobro\, and Banjo.&nbsp\;\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps
 ://youtu.be/ooWKbLbheXw?feature=shared\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/eTK3JfR
 Oi_c?feature=shared\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/04/07-25-26_GreenwoodRye_IG_1080x1440.jpg
END:VEVENT
