DESCRIPTION:Travel through the rich storytelling traditions of Africa and 
 the Afro-Caribbean world in this creative and energetic arts integration c
 amp! Rising 3rd through 5th grade campers will explore folktales through d
 ance\, music\, theatre\, visual art\, and performance while discovering th
