DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nEvery Tuesday & Thursday Morning in July we will b
 e doing morning yoga online via zoom.\n\nJoin Vi on your mat for beginner 
 friendly yoga flows. Designed to help you drop into your day with intentio
 n. Take a moment on your mat for yourself.\n\nThese are Donation based eve
