SUMMARY:Football Night
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join us for a signature event\, Mars Hill University Football Night. \nThis event will feature a delicious meal catered by High Ridge Smokehouse\, greetings from Coach Barnette and other football alums\, exclusive items and memorabilia up for bid during our silent auction\, and raffle items! \nMars Hill University Football Night will be our kick-off event as we embark on an impactful year for the Lions Athletic Club. \nDinner tickets: $75 per person \nGet tickets \nAll proceeds from Football Night will go to enhance the student-athlete experience at Mars Hill University.
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/football-night/
