X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville Writers": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-writers/events/315695061/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_writers
X-SOURCE:AVL Writers
UID:event_315695061@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260717T031308Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T200000
SUMMARY:Weekly Critique
DESCRIPTION:AVL Writers\nThis is the standing weekly critique. Bring anyth
 ing new you're working on to share with the group. If you don't have a pro
 ject to share\, you are most welcome to attend\, discuss\, and get inspire
 d.\n\nFor our group discussion\, please bring at least 8-10 printed copies
  of your piece. That way\, we can all read through each other's work and p
 rovide feedback.\n\nSharing our creative efforts is an important part of t
 he writing process. I'm really looking forward to reading what you've been
  working on. Don't worry if it's still a rough draft.\n\nIf you're having 
 trouble finding us\, look for a placard on the table with the group's name
 .\n\nIf you would like to join our group email list for updates regarding 
 contests\, events\, and more [you can sign up on our website](https://avlw
 riters.com/).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-writers/events/315695061/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260715T154746Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260715T154746Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Shutupandwriteasheville": "https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/315714212/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_shutupandwriteasheville
X-SOURCE:Shut Up & Write Western NC
UID:event_315714212@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260717T031334Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T200000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® in Hendersonville
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\nJoin us for some fo
 cused writing time. All writers and all experience levels are welcome and 
 don’t worry\, no one will see what you've written. This session is about
  getting your writing done and meeting other writers in your area.\n\nWhen
  you show up\, say hello to everyone\, grab a drink\, and get your writing
  tools ready. Once you’re all settled\, take some time to chat with your
  fellow writers. Once everyone’s arrived\, I will lead quick introductio
 ns and then set the timer for our quiet and focused writing session.\n\nAf
 terward\, we’ll have time to chat and get to know each other. We often t
 alk about our successes and challenges as writers. If you don’t have tim
 e to stick around\, no worries!\n\n**A note about the format**\nWe don’t
  host critiques or readings. These events are a safe space for writers of 
 all skill levels and genres to work on their craft\, so no one will read o
 r critique your writing.\n\nFor our full event schedule\, visit [https://s
 hutupwrite.com](https://www.shutupwrite.com).\n\n**Other Important Details
 :**\nWiFi name/password: [PLEASE INCLUDE DETAILS]\nTravel / Parking info: 
 [PLEASE INCLUDE DETAILS]
