UID:138b35ae8ee76d0ea56ccca4fd77f229@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:Legacy\, Gratitude\, and other Lasting Truths Join us for a mo
 rning of empowerment\, connections among women in business\, and inspirati
 on from speaker Leah Wong Ashburn. Leah shares candid stories of leadershi
 p during crisis and loss. She is at the helm of Highland Brewing Company\,
  one of the pioneering craft breweries of the American South\, founded by 
 her father\, Oscar Wong. Her talk shares a journey of devastating events a
 nd personal loss entwined with recovery\, peace\, and joy. Our audience wi
 ll 
LOCATION:Asheville\, NC
