 join Tarana and Ihsan in\nChants of Universal Peace and Sufi Tales\nSunday
 August 8\n6:30-8pm(arrive at 6:20pm)Eastern daylight savings US time\nShar
 ing Presence\, Voice\, and Hearts in Peace for all Beings\n\nemail tarana.
 wesley@gmail.com for the Zoom link\n\nDance with us second Sunday of every
  month.
